data: {"id": "bb352188770c46c4-thinking-parallel_evidence-271", "run_id": "bb352188770c46c4", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "read_context_archive", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "Tool `query_pod_logs` returned logs for pod `workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` (namespace `aiops-case-08`, node `node2`). Logs indicate OOM-related keyword matches and increasing memory allocation (38MB to 4", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788799554640, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_762a0d9be26e419698367b2b", "tool_sequence": 8, "semantic_success": true, "result": "Tool `query_pod_logs` returned logs for pod `workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` (namespace `aiops-case-08`, node `node2`). Logs indicate OOM-related keyword matches and increasing memory allocation (38MB to 46MB+) for the `app` container. Result is truncated due to backend `max_hits` and `tool_query` `max_records` limits.\nkey_facts: [\"Entity: pod `workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` (uid: `cfa13c1e-da2a-4e37-8baa-ec4be4c24c35`), namespace `aiops-case-08`, node `node2`, container `app`.\", \"Log Query: Searched ES index `filebeat-*` for keywords `OOM`, `Killed`, `memory`, `limit`, `Out of memory`.\", \"Counts: 192 matched, 30 returned. Truncated by `max_hits` (192->100) and `max_records` (100->30).\", \"Evidence: Logs show `message: \", \"conflicts []:\", \"missing [\\\"No OOMKill or CrashLoopBackOff events/logs explicitly visible in the truncated output; only progressive memory allocation increases shown.\\\"],\", \"raw_ref [\\\"elasticsearch\\\", \\\".ds-filebeat-8.5.1-2026.08.21-000003\\\"]\"]", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/bb352188770c46c4-g1/tools/011-evidence-read_context_archive.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/bb352188770c46c4-g1/tools/