ts: [\"The query keywords include 'OOM', 'Killed', 'Out of memory', but the visible evidence snippets (fact-0b..., fact-62...) contain 'info' level logs about 'memory allocation advanced', not explicit OOM killer events. This may indicate the logs are precursors or the keyword match is on the word 'memory'.\"]\nmissing: [\"Logs containing actual 'Killed', 'OOM', or error-level messages are not visible in the truncated preview.\", \"Next offset available (5000) implies more data exists but was not retrieved.\", \"No Exit Codes or CrashLoopBackOff events visible in this log query result.\", \"Pod lifecycle status (CrashLoopBackOff) is not explicitly confirmed in this log snippet, though context_archive path suggests it.\", \"Container 'app' resource limits (requests/limits) are not visible in these logs.\"]", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/bb352188770c46c4-g1/tools/015-evidence-read_context_archive.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/bb352188770c46c4-g1/tools/015-evidence-read_context_archive.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/bb352188770c46c4-g1/tools/015-evidence-read_context_archive.summary.txt"}

